  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/third-path-to-perfection.webp
  Description: You have made great progress in your personal studies of enlightenment.
    Choose one of the saving throws you selected for path to perfection or second
    path to perfection. Your proficiency rank for the chosen type of save increases
    to legendary. When you roll a critical failure on the chosen type of save, you
    get a failure instead. When you roll a failure on the chosen type of save against
    an effect that deals damage, you take half damage.
